== History ==

* On 4/5/2026, the Hero Dark Prince was added into the game, along with [[Bowler/Hero|Hero Bowler]]
* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, the rhino spawn damage to crown towers was completely removed (307 to 0 at level 11). The rhino's first charge distance increased to 2.5 tiles (from 0 tiles) and the ability deploy time decreased to 1 second (from 2 seconds)